    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sonic Surge: Rhythm Showdown</strong> is a high-energy rhythm game where players face off in pulse-pounding musical battles. Set in a vibrant, electrifying world, players must time their moves to dynamic beats, mastering complex rhythms to unleash powerful combos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a blend of fast-paced action\u00a0<i>Sonic Surge</i> offers an exhilarating experience that challenges reflexes and rewards precision. Perfect for rhythm game enthusiasts and competitive players alike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sonic Surge: Rhythm Showdown</strong> is a high-energy rhythm game where players face off in pulse-pounding musical battles. Set in a vibrant, electrifying world, players must time their moves to dynamic beats, mastering complex rhythms to unleash powerful combos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a blend of fast-paced action\u00a0<i>Sonic Surge</i> offers an exhilarating experience that challenges reflexes and rewards precision. Perfect for rhythm game enthusiasts and competitive players alike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
